# 🛑 Normalise to LF in the repository, always.
#
# Without this, line endings depend on each contributor's core.autocrlf. A
# Windows contributor with it switched off commits CRLF, and CRLF is not a
# cosmetic difference here: a shell script or an entrypoint with CRLF fails on
# Linux with a "bad interpreter" error that names the right file and gives no
# hint why, and the Caddyfile and Dockerfile are read inside containers that
# have never seen a carriage return.
#
# eol=lf rather than plain text=auto, because text=auto alone still writes CRLF
# into Windows working copies, and the files below are read by Linux tools from
# a bind mount of exactly that working copy.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files that must never be touched by normalisation. A "fix" to the bytes of a
# binary is silent and total.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.eot   binary
*.otf   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.gz    binary
*.tar   binary
*.whl   binary

# 🛑 The abuse corpus is hostile input by design (§9.4). Its archives encode
# traversal paths, symlink loops, zip bombs and deliberately malformed headers;
# normalising a byte in any of them would quietly turn an attack case into a
# passing test. Diffs are suppressed for the same reason the corpus is
# append-only: nobody should be editing these by hand.
tests/Fixtures/AbuseCorpus/**  -text -diff

# Better diffs where Git can be told what the language is.
*.php        diff=php
*.blade.php  diff=html
*.css        diff=css
*.html       diff=html
*.md         diff=markdown

# Construction and CI material, excluded from `git archive` so a source
# tarball contains the product and not the scaffolding around it (§15.6).
/.github        export-ignore
/.gitattributes export-ignore
/.gitignore     export-ignore
/compose.dev.yaml export-ignore
/phpstan.neon      export-ignore
/phpstan-strict.neon export-ignore
/phpunit.xml    export-ignore
/pint.json      export-ignore
/rector.php     export-ignore
/tests          export-ignore
CONTRIBUTING.md export-ignore
